{"text": "From: Imogen Ashby-Voce <accounts@harcastlesurveying.example>\nTo: Callum Rutherglen <c.rutherglen@harcastlesurveying.example>\nCc: Priyanka Venn <p.venn@harcastlesurveying.example>\nDate: Mon, 10 Nov 2025 09:12:44 +0000\nSubject: RE: RE: Expenses claim EXP-2025-1147 - 3 things outstanding\n\nHi Callum,\n\nThanks. Please don't send card details by email again - I've deleted your message from the shared inbox and so should you. I've set the refund up from what you sent, so no need to resend.\n\nWhere we are on claim EXP-2025-1147 (employee no. HS0388):\n\n1. The Mill Race Hotel, Leeds, 2 nights from 21/10/2025, £238.00. This went on the company Amex ending 51947, not your own card, so I've taken it off the claim. I still need the VAT receipt (their VAT no. is GB 418 7729 06 if you need to ring them).\n2. Mileage Sheffield - Hebden Bridge - Sheffield, 3 trips, 212 miles at 45p per mile = £95.40. HMRC wants the vehicle on the claim: I have your Octavia as YK21 HXT - still right?\n3. Moorgate Plant Hire deposit £400 paid on your personal Visa on 23 Oct. Approved by Priyanka. We'll reimburse with payroll on the 28th to the account we hold for you (sort code 40-51-62, account ending 6819).\n\nTotal now payable to you: £495.40.\n\nImogen\nHarcastle Surveying Ltd | Finance | 0114 496 0133\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Callum Rutherglen\nSent: 07 November 2025 18:03\nTo: Accounts\nSubject: RE: Expenses claim EXP-2025-1147 - 3 things outstanding\n\nImogen - the plant hire lot charged me twice (2 x 400). They say they can only refund to the card but their machine was down, can you sort it with them direct? Card is my Visa 4189 9264 4982 6610, exp 04/27, security code 380, name on it is MR C J RUTHERGLEN. Billing postcode S11 8TP.\nAlso I'm off from Weds 12th for the op on my knee so anything else ring me on 07700 900118 before then.\nCal\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Accounts\nSent: 06 November 2025 11:40\nTo: Callum Rutherglen\nSubject: Expenses claim EXP-2025-1147 - 3 things outstanding\n\nHi Callum, three items on your October claim can't go through Concur as submitted - hotel, mileage and a £400 deposit with no receipt. Can you send what you have? Anything not sorted by month end goes on your P11D. Thanks, I.A-V.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "378 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Imogen Ashby-Voce", "Callum Rutherglen", "Priyanka Venn", "Cal", "Callum", "I.A-V"], "companies": ["Harcastle Surveying Ltd", "Amex", "Mill Race Hotel", "Moorgate Plant Hire", "Concur"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Leeds", "Sheffield", "Moorgate", "Yorkshire", "Hebden Bridge", "S11 8TP"], "health": ["knee", "op"], "sensitive": ["P11D"], "names": ["Imogen", "Callum", "Priyanka", "Cal", "I.A", "V"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.6999999955296516, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 23, "text": "Imogen Ashby-Voce", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Imogen Ashby-Voce"}, {"start": 25, "end": 60, "text": "accounts@harcastlesurveying.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "accounts@harcastlesurveying.example"}, {"start": 66, "end": 83, "text": "Callum Rutherglen", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Callum Rutherglen"}, {"start": 85, "end": 124, "text": "c.rutherglen@harcastlesurveying.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "c.rutherglen@harcastlesurveying.example"}, {"start": 130, "end": 143, "text": "Priyanka Venn", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Priyanka Venn"}, {"start": 145, "en